ithout. If it is only on a specific project though (not reproducible with an empty project), then it may not be possible to test with a non-mono version if your project uses C#.\n\nGiven it sounds your reproduction is not fully consistent and it happens under different circumstances, there is probably not much we can do without some sort of crash error message or more details. Aside from testing on other versions of the editor and trying to create an MRP, I would also suggest starting Godot using the terminal rather than the desktop icon, since then you should be able to check the terminal for the error message in case it crashes again and this may give us more information to go off of.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4767320414/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4784226361","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120506#issuecomment-4784226361","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120506","id":4784226361,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHSmAOQ","user":{"login":"Defoger","id":67749277,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NzQ5Mjc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67749277?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Defoger","html_url":"https://github.com/Defoger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Defoger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Defoger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Defoger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Defoger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Defoger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Defoger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users